  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Fire On My Tongue** (1 other source): Opens set 1 and flows directly into Bronzeback [1]\n- **Taking Water** (1 other source): Opens set 2, segueing into Ice Bridges [1]\n- **Psycho** (1 other source): Runs into Pyramid Country, which then leads into Ole Slewfoot, closing the set 2 sequence [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Come On Down The Mountain Katie Daly**: back after 440 archived shows (2500 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **7 Weeks In County**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **The Old Mountaineer**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Auld Lang Syne**: back after 308 archived shows (1826 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Hands On The Wheel**: back after 58 archived shows (365 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Blues Stay Away From Me**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Old Man At The Mill**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **I'm Gone, Long Gone**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: In the Clear, Richard Petty [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-12-31.billystrings2023-12-31G-Man** (recommended): audience recording; 38 songs; 229 min [1]\n- **billystrings2023-12-31**: source not stated; 38 songs; 228 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Billy played a Casio DG-20 synth guitar at this show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-12-31.billystrings2023-12-31G-Man**: taped by G-Man; transferred by G-Man; source: Aud> Rode M5> Tascam DR-40X [1]\n- **billystrings2023-12-31**: taped by Swamprat; source: Schoeps MK22 (Din) @ 10'-> Zoom F3 @ 32 Bit Float [2]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK22 microphones in DIN configuration, placed about ten feet from the stage, into a Zoom F3 at 32-bit float; Transfer went from SD card to hard drive, then through Reaper and Ozone 11 for processing [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-12-29 UNO Arena Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-12-29-uno-lakefront-regular/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-12-29 UNO Arena Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-12-29-uno-lakefront-regular/) [5]",
